# AI / LLM: Gemini only

- For any AI or LLM features in this codebase, use **only Google Gemini** (e.g. `@google/generative-ai`, Gemini API).
- Do **not** add or use OpenAI, Anthropic, or other LLM providers.
- Store the Gemini API key in environment variables (e.g. `GEMINI_API_KEY`), never in source.
